              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "JEANETTE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent recipe and I've made for 50 years. Use 1/2 c cocoa. Sift all dry ingredients together, make a well and add your mixed together milk and miracle whip or heilmans. Gently fold until all is incorporated. This will make your cake less dense. Do not use a mixer or your cake will be flat.",
            "datePublished": "2021-04-25T15:26:31.650Z"
          },
          {
