            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Joan"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have been making this cake for over 50 years. My Mom used to make it. I use 1 1/2 tsp. soda, 1/4 tsps. salt, 4 Heaping tbls. cocoa and 1 c. each, cold water and miracle whip. Flour, sugar and vanila amounts as receipe says. I also use this for my whoopie pies.. Bake in tube pan.",
